<body lang=3D"EN-US" link=3D"#467886" vlink=3D"#96607D" style=3D"word-wrap:=
break-word">
<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">To Whom It May Concern,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Pursuant to ORS 192.311 et seq., I am requesting the=
 following records:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All public records requests received by the Oregon P=
arks and Recreation Department from January 1, 2023 to present, including f=
or each: the date received, the date of agency response, the method of prod=
uction (electronic or physical mail),
 whether a fee was assessed, whether a fee waiver was requested, whether a =
fee waiver was granted, and whether the request was fulfilled in whole, in =
part, or denied.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All written policies, procedures, or guidelines gove=
rning the agency's response to public records requests, including any inter=
nal guidance on production format, fee assessment, and timeline compliance.=
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All records reflecting instances where the agency mi=
ssed the statutory five-business-day response deadline under ORS 192.324, f=
rom January 1, 2023 to present.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All records reflecting the involvement of the OPRD D=
irector, OPRD Interim Director, or OPRD Deputy Director in the review, appr=
oval, or direction of responses to public records requests from January 1, =
2023 to present, including any communications
 in which executive staff directed the content, timing, or format of a resp=
onse.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All records reflecting communications between OPRD l=
egal counsel and executive staff regarding public records requests, includi=
ng any guidance on withholding, delaying, or limiting production of records=
.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">All records reflecting instances where OPRD legal co=
unsel reviewed a public records request prior to response, from January 1, =
2023 to present.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I request that responsive records be produced on a r=
olling basis as they are identified rather than held until the request is f=
ully processed.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please be advised that I expect all records potentia=
lly responsive to this request to be preserved immediately. Any destruction=
, deletion, modification, or alteration of responsive records following rec=
eipt of this request may constitute
 spoliation and will be treated accordingly.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">If any record or portion of a record is withheld, I =
require the following for each withheld item: the specific statutory exempt=
ion claimed, the date of the record, the author, and all recipients. A blan=
ket exemption claim is insufficient
 and will not be accepted as compliance.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I am requesting a fee waiver on the grounds that thi=
s request serves the public interest by enabling public oversight of agency=
 compliance with Oregon public records law. This request is not commercial =
in nature. Responsive records will
 be used to inform and supplement a public archive documenting institutiona=
l conduct, accessible at oprdvolunteerabuse.org. Public access to this info=
rmation advances transparency and accountability in government.<o:p></o:p><=
/p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I am further requesting that all responsive records =
be produced electronically in PDF or equivalent digital format and delivere=
d to rsw@rswfire.com.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please confirm receipt of this request in writing wi=
thin the statutory five-business-day window pursuant to ORS 192.324.<o:p></=
o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
